# Check every text file out with LF on every platform.
#
# Prettier's `endOfLine` defaults to "lf", and Git's `core.autocrlf=true` — the
# usual Windows default — rewrites files to CRLF on checkout. The two disagree,
# so a fresh clone on Windows fails `npm run lint` before a single line has been
# edited. Normalising here fixes it for everyone rather than asking each
# contributor to reconfigure Git.
* text=auto eol=lf

